OL,5,G0310 Abandoned Engineering
OL,6,     FStrange structures rusting away at
OL,7,     Fsea. Once cutting-edge in design
OL,8,     Fand construction, they now lie
OL,9,     Fdisused, contaminated and
OL,10,     Fdangerous. But who built them? And
OL,11,     Fwhy were they abandoned?
